        },
        {
          "text": "Uzikhethele abahluleli nababonisi kuwo wonke amasango akho uJehova uNkulunkulu wakho akunika wona ngokwezizwe zakho; futhi bayokwahlulela abantu ngokwahlulela okulungileyo.",
